@startuml R4_Package_AiReviewer
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 260
skinparam rectangle {
  roundCorner 12
}
title UML package diagram: ai-reviewer service (apps/ai-reviewer/app)
package "main.py\nFastAPI app, router wiring" as N0
package "Internal API (X-Internal-Key)\ninternal_routes.py, rag_routes.py" as N1
package "Standalone reviewer UI APIs\naccount_routes, admin_routes, format_routes, storage_routes" as N2
package "PDF processing\npdf_utils, rag_extraction, pdf_comparison, importer, pdf_to_latex*, pdf_structured_*, pdf_to_latex_worker" as N3
package "Review and format logic\npre_review, reviewer, review_types, format_checker, format_db" as N4
package "Account and storage support\nsecurity, storage, storage_subscription, storage_mail, storage_maintenance, server_lock" as N5
package "config\nconfig.py (settings)" as N6
package "Persistence (SQLite)\ndb, accounts_db, admin_db, storage_db" as N7
N0 ..> N1 : "«use»"
N0 ..> N2 : "«use»"
N1 ..> N3 : "«use»"
N1 ..> N4 : "«use»"
N2 ..> N4 : "«use»"
N2 ..> N5 : "«use»"
N4 ..> N3 : "«use»"
N4 ..> N6 : "«use»"
N7 ..> N6 : "«use»"
N7 ..> N5 : "«use»"
legend bottom
Derived from the imports in apps/ai-reviewer/app/*.py (origin/main); not every edge is drawn (main.py also uses the persistence package; security and config are used by several packages). Green = service code, purple = data store, grey = config.
endlegend
@enduml
